1
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:27,680
Mr Gao,

2
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:28,440
what happened?

3
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:29,720
I spilled some wine.

4
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:30,880
I'll go change my suit.

5
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:33,640
What happened to Mr Gao?

6
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:35,520
Oh no!

7
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:36,560
Mr Zhou,

8
00:01:37,080 --> 00:01:38,040
Young Master Lu is back.

9
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:43,920
When did he come back?

10
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:44,640
I don't know.

11
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:47,040
Ah...

12
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:47,640
Mr. Li...

13
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:48,320
Mr. Li, you...

14
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:48,600
It's okay.

15
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:49,280
I fell by myself.

16
00:01:58,520 --> 00:01:59,040
Lu Xu,

17
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:02,400
today is the press conference. What do you want to do?

18
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:04,080
Why did you hit Mr. Gao and Mr. Li?

19
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,400
Brother-in-law,

20
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:15,600
Mr. Gao and Mr. Li are profiteers.

21
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:17,520
As the person in charge, you don't care about it.

22
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,760
I, as the heir, can't just ignore it.

23
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:43,160
I just found out about it.

24
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:46,560
I'll handle it properly.

25
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:47,640
Lu Xu,

26
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,040
what are you doing here?

27
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:56,920
Haven't seen you in over half a year.

28
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:58,840
Did you miss me?

29
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,400
My dear sister,

30
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:08,240
of course, I'm here to give you and my brother-in-law

31
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:10,240
a big surprise.

32
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,400
Li Xiaorou,

33
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,680
it's about time.

34
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:15,680
Let's start the show.

35
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,240
Distinguished guests,

36
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,160
dear media friends,

37
00:03:28,160 --> 00:03:28,720
good evening.

38
00:03:29,160 --> 00:03:30,480
Thank you for taking the time

39
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:31,600
to join us here today.

40
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,360
Now, I'd like to announce

41
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:36,240
the Golden Thread Urban Visitor Series Fashion Show

42
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:37,560
officially begins!

43
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:51,520
Today, there are no unattainable runways,

44
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:53,920
only the must-have items you want to wear out.

45
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:55,200
We believe

46
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:58,040
real fashion is in your everyday wardrobe.

47
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,480
What's wrong?

48
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:49,600
Nothing.

49
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:50,920
Maybe

50
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,080
I've been sitting too long.

51
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,080
My back hurts a bit.

52
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:55,360
Don't worry,

53
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,040
no one can shake your position.

54
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,000
Mr. Zhou,

55
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,400
we meet again.

56
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,240
Honey,

57
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:31,120
Jenny's designs are just so-so.

58
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:37,120
I really don't know what my mom was thinking,

59
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:40,320
giving her the position of chief designer.

60
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:46,880
Do you still

61
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,920
have that note?

62
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,800
Why haven't you contacted me?

63
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,240
Ladies and gentlemen,

64
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:03,920
tonight's fashion show comes to an end.

65
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:06,200
Thank you to everyone behind the scenes,

66
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:07,720
and to all of you here

67
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,160
for joining us on this

68
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:11,680
exciting journey of self-expression.

69
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:14,400
After the show,

70
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:15,160
now,

71
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,240
let's welcome

72
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,400
the next segment with applause.

73
00:06:17,440 --> 00:06:19,640
Please welcome the head of Golden Thread,

74
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:21,280
Mr. Zhou Jian, to the stage.

75
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,480
What's going on?

76
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:25,320
Why is Lu Xu up there?

77
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,360
Dear guests and media friends,

78
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:33,600
welcome to the new product launch

79
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:35,400
of Golden Thread.

80
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,360
Today,

81
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,400
we'll not only showcase new products,

82
00:06:40,320 --> 00:06:41,960
but also announce

83
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:44,120
two important things.

84
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:46,080
Once upon a time,

85
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:48,200
under the leadership of my mother, Annie,

86
00:06:48,760 --> 00:06:51,520
Golden Thread became the leader in the industry.

87
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,120
From this year,

88
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:56,040
the Dark Fairy Tale series

89
00:06:56,440 --> 00:06:59,720
will be our first step into the luxury market.

90
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:02,680
This lady, Jiang Li,

91
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,880
will become the chief designer

92
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:07,280
of Dark Fairy Tale.

93
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:20,680
Dark Fairy Tale's designer?

94
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:22,960
She's so young!

95
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:28,120
And,

96
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:31,200
she's also my fiancée.

97
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:34,440
What's going on?

98
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,240
He already has a fiancee?

99
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:39,560
What? A fiancee?

100
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:41,240
So sudden.

101
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:43,600
You're done.

102
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:05,840
She didn't leave with Lu Xu.

103
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,160
[Jiang Li,]

104
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:24,760
[let's meet up.]

105
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,480
So you're hiding here.

106
00:08:30,880 --> 00:08:31,960
Name your price.

107
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,640
What?

108
00:08:36,800 --> 00:08:37,600
Me and Lu Xu?

109
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:39,720
Don't play dumb with me.

110
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:42,720
You're just an unmarried wife.

111
00:08:43,160 --> 00:08:44,680
Even if you wear the Lu family's wedding ring,

112
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:47,680
you're just a dog with a collar.

113
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:50,600
When the master doesn't throw you a bone,

114
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,640
you should learn to lie down

115
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,200
quietly.

116
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:57,320
The chief designer of Dark Fairy Tale

117
00:08:58,040 --> 00:09:00,040
is not someone like you should aspire to.

118
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,080
Why are you laughing?

119
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:08,240
You people born in the clouds,

120
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:10,960
do you think you are more precious than others?

121
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:14,120
People like me, born in the mud,

122
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:16,040
without background or financial resources,

123
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,600
even if I grind the bones into dust,

124
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:19,200
I can't reach the gold powder under your feet.

125
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:21,920
Have you ever thought that

126
00:09:22,160 --> 00:09:24,200
it's not because I'm Lu Xu's fiancée

127
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:26,200
that I can be the designer of Dark Fairy Tale,

128
00:09:26,640 --> 00:09:28,920
but because I can be the designer of Dark Fairy Tale

129
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:30,520
to be his fiancée.

130
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:34,240
Not all efforts

131
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:35,760
in this world

132
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,440
can be rewarded.

133
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:39,760
Cinderella

134
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:40,880
only exists

135
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:42,520
in fairy tales.

136
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,200
Cinderella.

137
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:48,960
People who wear crystal high heels every day

138
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:51,840
are just dancing in shackles.

139
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:55,680
Lu Xu can be my fiancé, or not.

140
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:57,440
Who cares?

141
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,920
That will be 15.9 yuan.

142
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:37,360
Here you are.

143
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:37,960
Thank you.

144
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:49,000
It hurts.

145
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:51,520
Lu Qianqian, why do you hit me so hard?

146
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,360
Thank you.

147
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:07,560
This one is good.

148
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:08,440
Try it.

149
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:11,600
Thank you.

150
00:11:16,040 --> 00:11:17,360
Your name is Jiang Li?

151
00:11:18,040 --> 00:11:20,120
Young Master Shen, your pick-up line is so old-fashioned.

152
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,560
It doesn't match your age.

153
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:24,520
You remember me?

154
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,480
Everyone in the city knows you,

155
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:28,360
the heir of Shen Family.

156
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:36,840
Lu Xu left you here alone?

157
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,040
You were there just now?

158
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:39,640
Yes.

159
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:42,480
It's just a marriage of convenience.

160
00:11:43,280 --> 00:11:44,480
He's not my guardian.

161
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:53,200
I'll do it.

162
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:04,440
The heir of the richest person in Lucheng

163
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:06,160
is eating rice ball in the convenience store at night.

164
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:09,320
This is more surprising than me

165
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,920
after being dumped at a convenience store meal.

166
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:13,680
The most ordinary things

167
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:14,640
are often the most delicious.

168
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:20,600
All right.

169
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:29,400
It's getting late.

170
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:30,640
I'm leaving.

171
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:32,320
Where do you live?

172
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:33,160
I'll give you a ride.

173
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:36,160
We'd better keep a distance.

174
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:37,480
After all,

175
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,680
I'm Lu Xu's fiancée.

176
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:52,920
Didn't I ask you to stay in Japan?

177
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:55,000
That place is too pretentious.

178
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:56,880
Living there is both fake and suffocating.

179
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:57,520
What's the point of staying there?

180
00:12:57,520 --> 00:12:59,320
I'll ask Yanyan to tidy up a room for you.

181
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:00,440
Move back to the ancestral house.

182
00:13:00,520 --> 00:13:01,600
I'm fine living in a hotel.

183
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:03,080
It's not good to live in the ancestral house.

184
00:13:03,800 --> 00:13:05,040
I just heard from Wu that

185
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:06,720
you made a mess at the fashion show again.

186
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:09,440
Anyway, Jiang Li becoming the chief designer of Dark Fairy Tale

187
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:11,080
will be announced sooner or later.

188
00:13:11,760 --> 00:13:13,920
I'm talking about your engagement to her.

189
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:16,960
I'm your only son.

190
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:20,080
Give the company to an outsider?

191
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:23,440
Lu Xu,

192
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:26,000
don't make any more messes for me to clean up.

193
00:13:26,560 --> 00:13:27,560
Behave yourself

194
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:28,440
until I return from abroad.

195
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:35,160
Sister,

196
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:37,440
do you really miss me?

197
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:02,080
Mr. Lu,

198
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:03,560
didn't Jiang Li go missing?

199
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:04,280
I didn't know

200
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,960
she opened a live broadcast room with a virtual address.

201
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:07,480
Where's Zhou Jian?

202
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:08,440
I don't know.

203
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:11,080
I don't care if Jiang Li is alive or dead.

204
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:12,080
Find her.

205
00:14:12,400 --> 00:14:13,000
Stop her.

206
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:14,120
Look!

207
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:15,000
Lu Qianqian is out!

208
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:15,560
Mr. Lu.

209
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:16,640
Wasn't Jiang Li missing?

210
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:17,480
Why did she suddenly reappear?

211
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:18,440
Mr. Lu.

212
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:19,720
Did you just find out

213
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,680
your husband cheated on you?

214
00:14:20,680 --> 00:14:21,680
The press conference of Dark Fairy Tale is about to start.

215
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:23,040
Does Annie know about it?

216
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:25,320
Will it affect the company's listing?

217
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:26,560
When will Annie come back?

218
00:14:26,560 --> 00:14:27,840
Mr. Lu,

219
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:40,960
there's a saying I like.

220
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:44,080
If heaven is not my home,

221
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:45,680
then hell

222
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:47,000
is my paradise.

223
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:49,520
Welcome to my paradise

224
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:51,240
and listen to my story.

225
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:52,480
Now,

226
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:54,120
it's just getting started.
